00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:58.398
that we have experienced and seen

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.732
along those Western Bay

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:02.368
and shorelines of western Japan.

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:03.936
The tsunami warning

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:04.871
as compared to

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:06.506
what was a major tsunami warning

00:05:06.506 --> 00:05:08.541
