00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.082
Now with a tsunami warning,

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.050
that downgrade,

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.851
that means waves up to three meters.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.486
That's roughly ten feet.

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:22.555
So that's still possible within this area

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:23.790
