00:05:27.927 --> 00:05:29.796
And then just looking at the basic

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.597
geometry of this area,

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:33.066
here's the Korean Peninsula.

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:34.400
Here's Russia.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.235
There is nothing

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:38.538
preventing the sloshing effect

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:39.205
