00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:47.847
And that is why we have

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.215
these tsunami warnings

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:50.950
that are ongoing several hours

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.186
after that initial initial earthquake

00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:53.686
that struck.

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:54.120
Here's a look

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.122
at some of those observed wave heights.

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:56.656
You can see

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.391
matching that

00:05:58.391 --> 00:06:00.727
narrative of about four feet in height

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:02.395
for some of those locations.

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.363
And really,

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.097
what's happening

00:06:04.097 --> 00:06:05.164
here is the fact

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:07.166
that this was such a shallow earthquake.

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:08.067
It was about

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:08.801
