And that displaced the water,

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:15.775
forcing a wave

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:17.810
at the surface of the ocean.

00:06:18.077 --> 00:06:19.245
And some of the boys

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:20.313
within this area,

00:06:20.313 --> 00:06:21.114
just off the west

00:06:21.114 --> 00:06:22.415
