00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.798
closer to the population density.

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:40.900
That wave has nowhere to go but up.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:41.634
And that is why

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:43.169
they initially projected this

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:45.438
