And there have downgraded that

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:56.249
to a tsunami warning.

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:58.851
So waves potentially upwards of ten feet.

00:06:58.851 --> 00:06:59.786
But nonetheless, John,

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:01.487
this was a powerful earthquake.

00:07:01.487 --> 00:07:03.923
We expect the aftershocks to continue.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:04.857
In fact,

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:06.692
50 million people felt some sort

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:08.761
of shaking from this particular event.

