00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:04.010
this area.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.844
Know these aftershocks.

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.212
That can be unnerving

00:09:06.212 --> 00:09:07.380
for people who are,

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.381
I think, already

00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:09.282
vulnerable there,

00:09:09.282 --> 00:09:11.584
but also extremely dangerous

00:09:11.584 --> 00:09:12.685
given what just happened

00:09:12.685 --> 00:09:14.086
with this very powerful earthquake.

00:09:14.086 --> 00:09:14.487
Derek Van

00:09:14.487 --> 00:09:15.888
Dam was watching this very closely

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:16.622
for us.

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:17.657
Keep us posted.

00:09:17.657 --> 00:09:19.825
We'll check back in with you in a bit.

00:09:19.825 --> 00:09:21.761
We are getting some new video

00:09:21.761 --> 00:09:23.229
just in where you can see

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:25.231
the power of this earthquake.

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:27.733
This from inside a home where you can see

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:28.568
that baby

00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:30.336
sitting there just going back and forth

00:09:30.336 --> 00:09:31.971
and back and forth.

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:32.538
Not to mention

00:09:32.538 --> 00:09:33.739
what's on the TV screen there.

00:09:33.739 --> 00:09:34.907
You could see out the window.

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:36.409
It's a 7.5

00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:37.743
magnitude earthquake

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:40.012
hitting Japan on New Year's Day.

